{"seq":1,"slug":"interactive-prompts","title":"交互式提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/interactive-prompts","wordCount":752,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"交互式提示\">交互式提示</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>交互式提示</strong>（Interactive Prompts）是 CLI 在运行过程中向用户提问、逐步收集输入的交互方式。它降低了一次性记住所有参数的门槛，代价是<strong>难以脚本化</strong>——因此它始终是命令行参数的补充，而非替代。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>交互式提示</th>\n<th>命令行参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>低，逐步引导</td>\n<td>高，需预先知道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可脚本化</td>\n<td>差，依赖人工输入</td>\n<td>好，可自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>初始化、危险操作确认</td>\n<td>日常操作、CI/CD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设计要点</td>\n<td>支持非交互降级路径</td>\n<td>提供帮助与校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>由此得出一条核心约束：<strong>任何交互式提示都必须有对应的非交互模式</strong>，通过参数传入全部取值，保证在管道和 CI 中可用。本文接着介绍 Rust 的 dialoguer、Node.js 的 prompts/inquirer，以及组件选型。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"何时使用交互式提示\">何时使用交互式提示</h2><p><strong>交互式提示</strong>（Interactive Prompts）适用于 CLI 工具需要收集用户输入的场景。与纯命令行参数相比，交互式提示降低了使用门槛，特别适合初始化向导和配置流程。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>项目初始化</td>\n<td>交互式提示</td>\n<td>选项多，用户不熟悉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日常操作</td>\n<td>命令行参数</td>\n<td>效率优先，可脚本化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>危险操作确认</td>\n<td>确认提示</td>\n<td>防止误操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次配置</td>\n<td>引导式提示</td>\n<td>一次性设置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户运行命令] --&gt; B{需要交互?}&#10;    B --&gt;|参数已完整| C[直接执行]&#10;    B --&gt;|参数缺失| D[交互式提示]&#10;    D --&gt; E[收集输入]&#10;    E --&gt; F[验证输入]&#10;    F --&gt;|无效| D&#10;    F --&gt;|有效| C\">graph TD\n    A[用户运行命令] --&gt; B{需要交互?}\n    B --&gt;|参数已完整| C[直接执行]\n    B --&gt;|参数缺失| D[交互式提示]\n    D --&gt; E[收集输入]\n    E --&gt; F[验证输入]\n    F --&gt;|无效| D\n    F --&gt;|有效| C</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 交互式提示应始终支持非交互模式（通过命令行参数传入所有值），以便在 CI/CD 和脚本环境中使用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rust-dialoguer\">Rust：dialoguer</h2><p><strong>dialoguer</strong> 是 Rust 生态中最流行的交互式提示库，提供确认、输入、选择和多选等组件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use dialoguer::{theme::ColorfulTheme, Confirm, Input, Select, MultiSelect, Password};&#10;&#10;fn interactive_setup() -&gt; Result&lt;(), Box&lt;dyn std::error::Error&gt;&gt; {&#10;    let theme = ColorfulTheme::default();&#10;&#10;    let name: String = Input::with_theme(&amp;theme)&#10;        .with_prompt(&quot;项目名称&quot;)&#10;        .default(&quot;my-project&quot;.into())&#10;        .validate_with(|input: &amp;String| {&#10;            if input.chars().all(|c| c.is_alphanumeric() || c == &#39;-&#39;) {&#10;                Ok(())&#10;            } else {&#10;                Err(&quot;项目名称只能包含字母、数字和连字符&quot;)&#10;            }&#10;        })&#10;        .interact_text()?;&#10;&#10;    let frameworks = vec![&quot;Axum&quot;, &quot;Actix-web&quot;, &quot;Rocket&quot;, &quot;Warp&quot;];&#10;    let framework_idx = Select::with_theme(&amp;theme)&#10;        .with_prompt(&quot;选择 Web 框架&quot;)&#10;        .items(&amp;frameworks)&#10;        .default(0)&#10;        .interact()?;&#10;&#10;    let features = vec![&quot;数据库&quot;, &quot;认证&quot;, &quot;日志&quot;, &quot;CORS&quot;, &quot;限流&quot;, &quot;WebSocket&quot;];&#10;    let selected_features = MultiSelect::with_theme(&amp;theme)&#10;        .with_prompt(&quot;选择功能模块（空格选择，回车确认）&quot;)&#10;        .items(&amp;features)&#10;        .defaults(&amp;[true, true, true, false, false, false])&#10;        .interact()?;&#10;&#10;    let db_password = Password::with_theme(&amp;theme)&#10;        .with_prompt(&quot;数据库密码&quot;)&#10;        .with_confirmation(&quot;确认密码&quot;, &quot;两次输入不一致&quot;)&#10;        .interact()?;&#10;&#10;    let confirm = Confirm::with_theme(&amp;theme)&#10;        .with_prompt(format!(&quot;确认创建项目 &#39;{}&#39;?&quot;, name))&#10;        .default(true)&#10;        .interact()?;&#10;&#10;    if confirm {&#10;        println!(&quot;创建项目: {}&quot;, name);&#10;        println!(&quot;框架: {}&quot;, frameworks[framework_idx]);&#10;        let chosen: Vec&lt;_&gt; = selected_features.iter().map(|&amp;i| features[i]).collect();&#10;        println!(&quot;功能: {:?}&quot;, chosen);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    if let Err(e) = interactive_setup() {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;错误: {}&quot;, e);&#10;        std::process::exit(1);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use dialoguer::{theme::ColorfulTheme, Confirm, Input, Select, MultiSelect, Password};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn interactive_setup() -> Result&#x3C;(), Box&#x3C;dyn std::error::Error>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let theme = ColorfulTheme::default();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let name: String = Input::with_theme(&#x26;theme)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_prompt(\"项目名称\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .default(\"my-project\".into())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .validate_with(|input: &#x26;String| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if input.chars().all(|c| c.is_alphanumeric() || c == '-') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Err(\"项目名称只能包含字母、数字和连字符\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .interact_text()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let frameworks = vec![\"Axum\", \"Actix-web\", \"Rocket\", \"Warp\"];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let framework_idx = Select::with_theme(&#x26;theme)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_prompt(\"选择 Web 框架\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .items(&#x26;frameworks)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .default(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .interact()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let features = vec![\"数据库\", \"认证\", \"日志\", \"CORS\", \"限流\", \"WebSocket\"];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let selected_features = MultiSelect::with_theme(&#x26;theme)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_prompt(\"选择功能模块（空格选择，回车确认）\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .items(&#x26;features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .defaults(&#x26;[true, true, true, false, false, false])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .interact()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let db_password = Password::with_theme(&#x26;theme)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_prompt(\"数据库密码\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_confirmation(\"确认密码\", \"两次输入不一致\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .interact()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let confirm = Confirm::with_theme(&#x26;theme)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_prompt(format!(\"确认创建项目 '{}'?\", name))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .default(true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .interact()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if confirm {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"创建项目: {}\", name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"框架: {}\", frameworks[framework_idx]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let chosen: Vec&#x3C;_> = selected_features.iter().map(|&#x26;i| features[i]).collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"功能: {:?}\", chosen);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Err(e) = interactive_setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"错误: {}\", e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::process::exit(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"node-js-prompts-与-inquirer\">Node.js：prompts 与 inquirer</h2><p>Node.js 生态中，<strong>prompts</strong> 轻量高效，<strong>inquirer</strong> 功能丰富，两者都广泛用于 CLI 交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import prompts from &#39;prompts&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface SetupResult {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  framework: string;&#10;  features: string[];&#10;  confirm: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function interactiveSetup(): Promise&lt;SetupResult&gt; {&#10;  const response = await prompts([&#10;    {&#10;      type: &#39;text&#39;,&#10;      name: &#39;name&#39;,&#10;      message: &#39;项目名称&#39;,&#10;      initial: &#39;my-project&#39;,&#10;      validate: (v: string) =&gt; /^[a-z0-9-]+$/.test(v) || &#39;只允许小写字母、数字和连字符&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      type: &#39;select&#39;,&#10;      name: &#39;framework&#39;,&#10;      message: &#39;选择框架&#39;,&#10;      choices: [&#10;        { title: &#39;Express&#39;, value: &#39;express&#39; },&#10;        { title: &#39;Fastify&#39;, value: &#39;fastify&#39; },&#10;        { title: &#39;Koa&#39;, value: &#39;koa&#39; },&#10;        { title: &#39;Hono&#39;, value: &#39;hono&#39; },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      type: &#39;multiselect&#39;,&#10;      name: &#39;features&#39;,&#10;      message: &#39;选择功能&#39;,&#10;      choices: [&#10;        { title: &#39;数据库&#39;, value: &#39;database&#39;, selected: true },&#10;        { title: &#39;认证&#39;, value: &#39;auth&#39;, selected: true },&#10;        { title: &#39;日志&#39;, value: &#39;logging&#39; },&#10;        { title: &#39;CORS&#39;, value: &#39;cors&#39; },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      type: &#39;confirm&#39;,&#10;      name: &#39;confirm&#39;,&#10;      message: &#39;确认创建?&#39;,&#10;      initial: true,&#10;    },&#10;  ]);&#10;&#10;  return response as SetupResult;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prompts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'prompts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SetupResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  framework</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  features</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confirm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interactiveSetup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetupResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> prompts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'项目名称'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      initial: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'my-project'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-z0-9-]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '只允许小写字母、数字和连字符'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'select'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'framework'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'选择框架'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      choices: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Express'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'express'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Fastify'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fastify'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Koa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'koa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'multiselect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'features'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'选择功能'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      choices: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据库'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'database'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, selected: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'认证'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'auth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, selected: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'日志'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'logging'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CORS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cors'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'确认创建?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SetupResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"组件类型对比\">组件类型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>dialoguer (Rust)</th>\n<th>prompts (Node.js)</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本输入</td>\n<td><code>Input</code></td>\n<td><code>text</code></td>\n<td>名称、路径等自由文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密码</td>\n<td><code>Password</code></td>\n<td><code>password</code></td>\n<td>敏感信息，隐藏输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确认</td>\n<td><code>Confirm</code></td>\n<td><code>confirm</code></td>\n<td>是/否决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单选</td>\n<td><code>Select</code></td>\n<td><code>select</code></td>\n<td>从列表中选一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多选</td>\n<td><code>MultiSelect</code></td>\n<td><code>multiselect</code></td>\n<td>从列表中选多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字</td>\n<td><code>Input&lt;f64&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>端口号、超时等数值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"非交互模式兼容\">非交互模式兼容</h2><p>成熟的 CLI 工具必须同时支持交互和非交互两种模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use clap::Parser;&#10;use dialoguer::{theme::ColorfulTheme, Input, Select};&#10;use std::io::IsTerminal;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Parser)]&#10;struct Cli {&#10;    #[arg(long)]&#10;    name: Option&lt;String&gt;,&#10;&#10;    #[arg(long)]&#10;    template: Option&lt;String&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn get_name(cli_value: Option&lt;String&gt;) -&gt; String {&#10;    if let Some(name) = cli_value {&#10;        return name;&#10;    }&#10;    if !std::io::stdin().is_terminal() {&#10;        eprintln!(&quot;错误: 非交互模式下必须提供 --name 参数&quot;);&#10;        std::process::exit(2);&#10;    }&#10;    Input::with_theme(&amp;ColorfulTheme::default())&#10;        .with_prompt(&quot;项目名称&quot;)&#10;        .interact_text()&#10;        .unwrap()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn get_template(cli_value: Option&lt;String&gt;) -&gt; String {&#10;    if let Some(t) = cli_value {&#10;        return t;&#10;    }&#10;    if !std::io::stdin().is_terminal() {&#10;        return &quot;default&quot;.to_string();&#10;    }&#10;    let templates = vec![&quot;default&quot;, &quot;minimal&quot;, &quot;full&quot;];&#10;    let idx = Select::with_theme(&amp;ColorfulTheme::default())&#10;        .with_prompt(&quot;选择模板&quot;)&#10;        .items(&amp;templates)&#10;        .default(0)&#10;        .interact()&#10;        .unwrap();&#10;    templates[idx].to_string()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let cli = Cli::parse();&#10;    let name = get_name(cli.name);&#10;    let template = get_template(cli.template);&#10;    println!(&quot;项目: {}, 模板: {}&quot;, name, template);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use clap::Parser;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use dialoguer::{theme::ColorfulTheme, Input, Select};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io::IsTerminal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Parser)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Cli {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(long)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: Option&#x3C;String>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[arg(long)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    template: Option&#x3C;String>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn get_name(cli_value: Option&#x3C;String>) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Some(name) = cli_value {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if !std::io::stdin().is_terminal() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(\"错误: 非交互模式下必须提供 --name 参数\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        std::process::exit(2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Input::with_theme(&#x26;ColorfulTheme::default())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_prompt(\"项目名称\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .interact_text()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn get_template(cli_value: Option&#x3C;String>) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Some(t) = cli_value {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return t;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if !std::io::stdin().is_terminal() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return \"default\".to_string();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let templates = vec![\"default\", \"minimal\", \"full\"];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let idx = Select::with_theme(&#x26;ColorfulTheme::default())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_prompt(\"选择模板\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .items(&#x26;templates)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .default(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .interact()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    templates[idx].to_string()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let cli = Cli::parse();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let name = get_name(cli.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let template = get_template(cli.template);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"项目: {}, 模板: {}\", name, template);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在非交互环境中使用默认值或要求显式参数，永远不要让工具在 CI 中阻塞等待输入。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((交互式提示))&#10;    组件类型&#10;      文本输入&#10;      密码输入&#10;      确认对话框&#10;      单选列表&#10;      多选菜单&#10;    Rust 生态&#10;      dialoguer&#10;      ColorfulTheme&#10;      输入验证&#10;    Node.js 生态&#10;      prompts&#10;      inquirer&#10;    设计原则&#10;      非交互模式兼容&#10;      输入验证前置&#10;      合理的默认值\">mindmap\n  root((交互式提示))\n    组件类型\n      文本输入\n      密码输入\n      确认对话框\n      单选列表\n      多选菜单\n    Rust 生态\n      dialoguer\n      ColorfulTheme\n      输入验证\n    Node.js 生态\n      prompts\n      inquirer\n    设计原则\n      非交互模式兼容\n      输入验证前置\n      合理的默认值</pre><ul>\n<li>交互式提示适合初始化向导和危险操作确认，日常操作应优先使用命令行参数</li>\n<li>dialoguer 是 Rust 生态的首选交互式提示库，提供完整的组件集合</li>\n<li>prompts 和 inquirer 在 Node.js 生态中各有优势，前者轻量后者功能丰富</li>\n<li>所有交互式功能都必须支持非交互模式，通过命令行参数绕过提示</li>\n<li>输入验证应在提示阶段完成，避免用户输入无效数据后才报错</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交互式提示","id":"交互式提示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"何时使用交互式提示","id":"何时使用交互式提示"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust：dialoguer","id":"rust-dialoguer"},{"level":2,"text":"Node.js：prompts 与 inquirer","id":"node-js-prompts-与-inquirer"},{"level":2,"text":"组件类型对比","id":"组件类型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"非交互模式兼容","id":"非交互模式兼容"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/error-handling"},"next":{"title":"进度与动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/progress-and-spinners"}}